        "body": "Hello! I love your art and would like to request a drawing. The drawing will be used for one of my youtube video!\n\nHere is my character REIRU : https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PV12CQT1kmfXIZno_9kmur8TW8FCqSar/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nShe has mint green hair with rainbow bangs. 2 strands of hair are framing her face. She has hazel beige brown eyes.\n\nPlease use the outfit she has on the references and please draw her with her hat and hoodie if possible.\n\nI would like for you to draw her with a pink electric guitar, I would like for her to look like she's playing music! You can choose the pose and expression based on this.\n\nThis drawing will be used in the video for my cover of this song : https://youtu.be/zVoEdfNBK4U?si=kvtm_SXbvMXLghq6\nI would like for you to draw something inspired by the song!\n\nPlease send the files with the character separated from the background (transparent background version) if possible, with no cropping, as it would be very helpful f or the video! Thank you ~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1PV12CQT1kmfXIZno_9kmur8TW8FCqSar/view?usp=drivesdk",
